const ServicesView: React.FC<{ services: Service[]; onAdd: (s: Service) => void; onEdit: (s: Service) => void; onDelete: (id: string) => void; }> = ({ services, onAdd, onEdit, onDelete }) => {
  const [isModalOpen, setIsModalOpen] = useState(false);
  const [editingService, setEditingService] = useState<Service | null>(null);
  const [formState, setFormState] = useState<Partial<Service>>({ name: '', category: CATEGORIES[0], duration: 30, price: 0, description: '' });
  const [isLoadingAI, setIsLoadingAI] = useState(false);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (editingService) setFormState(editingService);
    else setFormState({ name: '', category: CATEGORIES[0], duration: 30, price: 0, description: '' });
  }, [editingService, isModalOpen]);

  const handleSuggestAI = async () => {
    if (!formState.name) return alert("Digite o nome do serviço.");
    setIsLoadingAI(true);
    try {
      const desc = await generateServiceDescription(formState.name!, formState.category || 'Geral');
      setFormState(prev => ({ ...prev, description: desc }));
    } finally { setIsLoadingAI(false); }
  };

  return (
    <div className="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
        <h2 className="text-xl font-black italic uppercase">Catálogo de <span className="text-amber-500">Serviços</span></h2>
        <button onClick={() => { setEditingService(null); setIsModalOpen(true); }} className="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-lg font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2"><Plus size={16} /> NOVO</button>
      </div>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {services.map(s => (
          <div key={s.id} className="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-amber-500 transition-all group">
            <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <span className="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">{s.category}</span>
              <div className="flex gap-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                <button onClick={() => { setEditingService(s); setIsModalOpen(true); }} className="text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-500"><Edit2 size={16} /></button>
                <button onClick={() => onDelete(s.id)} className="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500"><Trash2 size={16} /></button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <h3 className="font-black italic text-lg mb-2 uppercase tracking-tight">{s.name}</h3>
            <p className="text-xs text-slate-500 italic mb-6 h-12 overflow-hidden leading-relaxed">{s.description}</p>
            <div className="flex justify-between items-center pt-4 border-t border-slate-50">
              <span className="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><Clock size={12} /> {s.duration} MIN</span>
              <span className="font-black text-amber-600 italic">R$ {s.price.toFixed(2)}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      {isModalOpen && (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[60] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <div className="bg-white w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
            <div className="p-5 bg-slate-900 text-white flex justify-between items-center">
              <h3 className="font-black italic uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">{editingService ? 'Editar' : 'Novo'} Serviço</h3>
              <button onClick={() => setIsModalOpen(false)}><X size={20} /></button>
            </div>
            <form className="p-6 space-y-4" onSubmit={(e) => {
              e.preventDefault();
              if (editingService) onEdit({ ...formState, id: editingService.id } as Service);
              else onAdd({ ...formState, id: `s${Date.now()}` } as Service);
              setIsModalOpen(false);
            }}>
              <input value={formState.name} onChange={e => setFormState({...formState, name: e.target.value})} placeholder="Nome do Serviço" required className="w-full p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl outline-none font-bold" />
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <input type="number" value={formState.price} onChange={e => setFormState({...formState, price: parseFloat(e.target.value)})} placeholder="Preço" required className="w-full p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl outline-none" />
                <input type="number" value={formState.duration} onChange={e => setFormState({...formState, duration: parseInt(e.target.value)})} placeholder="Minutos" required className="w-full p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl outline-none" />
              </div>
              <div className="relative">
                <textarea value={formState.description} onChange={e => setFormState({...formState, description: e.target.value})} placeholder="Descrição" required className="w-full p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl h-24 resize-none outline-none italic text-sm" />
                <button type="button" onClick={handleSuggestAI} disabled={isLoadingAI} className="absolute bottom-2 right-2 p-2 bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-400 disabled:opacity-50"><Sparkles size={14} /></button>
              </div>
              <button type="submit" className="w-full py-4 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">SALVAR</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
};

